      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IVORY HAMADA (6) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (22.36) at Shepparton. Yet to win here but has run some good races. Key runner on his best form. WHOPPI DEVERE (8) flew the lids with a sensational early split and hit the frame with a 1.5 lengths second (23.41) over 410m at Horsham. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to feature again. PAW NORBERT (2) recorded his best time this course and distance latest, finishing a 1.75 lengths second behind Paw Christie in 24.3. Has the ability and can measure up. SOUTHERN STYLE (4) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
